---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
    <div class="mt-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">Work Experience</h1>
        <div class="mt-12 space-y-12">
            <section class="group">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
                        <a href="https://zulip.com/history/#zulips-second-founding" target="_blank">Kandra Labs</a>
                    </h2>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 mt-1 sm:mt-0">Sep 2023 — Present</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mt-1">Software Engineer</p>
                <div class="mt-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                    <!-- Project details could go here if needed in future -->
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="group border-t border-zinc-800 pt-12">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
                        <a href="https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2023/projects/ijktWPlO" target="_blank">Google Summer of Code</a>
                    </h2>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 mt-1 sm:mt-0">May 2023 — Sep 2023</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mt-1">Student Developer</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Developed the "Follow Topics" feature, addressing <a href="https://zulip.readthedocs.io/en/7.0/outreach/gsoc.html#:~:text=these%20are%20two%20of%20the%205%20most%20requested%20features%20for%20the%20Zulip%20project%20overall." class="text-blue-400 hover:underline underline-offset-4">one of the five most requested features</a> at Zulip.
                        A core piece of Zulip's notification subsystem.
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Built the <a href="https://github.com/zulip/zulip/issues/22829" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline underline-offset-4">"@topic mention"</a> feature — a Rust community requested feature.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-100">Received an offer to work full-time at the end of the program.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="group border-t border-zinc-800 pt-12">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
                        <a href="https://zulip.com/" target="_blank">Zulip</a>
                    </h2>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 mt-1 sm:mt-0">Oct 2022 — April 2023</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mt-1">Open Source Contributor — Part-time</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Developed the "unmute topics in muted streams" feature, <a href="https://blog.zulip.com/2023/05/31/zulip-7-0-released/#:~:text=unmuting%20topics%20in%20muted%20streams" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline underline-offset-4">highlighted in the Zulip 7.0 release</a>.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="group border-t border-zinc-800 pt-12">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
                        <a href="https://ques10.com/" target="_blank">Ques10</a>
                    </h2>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 mt-1 sm:mt-0">April 2021 — July 2021</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mt-1">Backend Developer Intern</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Increased post visibility via sitemap generation & submission to Google Search Console.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Implemented the views-based payment feature.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-baseline space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold leading-none shrink-0">•</span>
                        <span>Reduced manual human effort by implementing the <a href="/blog/1" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline underline-offset-4">Tag Merging Optimization</a> feature.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </div>
        <section class="mt-24">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">Education</h1>
            <ul class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-zinc-300">
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span>Bachelor of Technology, Electrical Engineering — <span class="font-medium text-zinc-100">NIT Hamirpur (2023)</span></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span>HINT 5.0 — Won the <a href="https://devfolio.co/projects/delotto-8913" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4">"Best Overall Design" award</a>; Top 5 team.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span>Prodyogiki — Team secured <span class="font-bold text-zinc-100">second position</span> in robotics event "Lost - Lander".</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span>Stack Overflow — Reached <span class="font-bold text-zinc-100">150k+</span> people with <span class="font-bold text-zinc-100">1000+</span> reputation points. <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/14264497/prakhar" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4">Profile</a>.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span><a href="https://github.com/team-ojas" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4">Team Ojas</a> — Led an online treasure hunt event which was a huge success.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                    <span><a href="https://github.com/GDSC-NITH" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4">GDSC</a> — Part of the first-ever Google Developer Student Club team at college.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>